═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<h1>&#128167; RUMAWASCO &mdash; System Users &amp; Access Control</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Water Billing &amp; Management System &mdash; Preconfigured User Accounts</p>
<p class="meta">Document prepared: August 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Confidential &mdash; Internal Use Only</p>

<div class="warning">
  <strong>&#9888; Security Notice:</strong> This document contains sensitive credentials. Distribute only to authorised personnel. All users <strong>must change their passwords</strong> on first login. Do not share this document via unsecured channels.
</div>

<div class="info">
  <strong>&#128274; Default Password Policy:</strong> All accounts below use the temporary default password shown. Passwords must be at least 8 characters and changed immediately upon first access. The system enforces password change on accounts flagged <em>must_change_password = true</em>.
</div>

