  * Additional accounts for Utility Manager, Finance Manager, Metering Supervisor, Accountant, and Auditor
  can be created by the Super Admin via <strong>Settings &rarr; Users &amp; Access Control &rarr; Invite User</strong>.
</p>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 2 — ROLE DESCRIPTIONS
═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<h2>2. Role Descriptions &amp; Responsibilities</h2>

<table class="users">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Level</th>
      <th>Role</th>
      <th>Description</th>
      <th>Who Assigns</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="level-tag">L1</span></td>
      <td><span class="role-badge badge-purple">Super Admin</span></td>
      <td>Full system access. System configuration, security and all operations. Can manage all users and roles.</td>
      <td>System only</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="level-tag">L2</span></td>
      <td><span class="role-badge badge-blue">Utility Manager</span></td>
      <td>Overall utility operations and strategic approvals. Full operational oversight except system configuration.</td>
      <td>Super Admin</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="level-tag">L2</span></td>
      <td><span class="role-badge badge-blue">Operations Manager</span></td>
      <td>Day-to-day operations management across all modules. Can invite and manage lower-level users.</td>
      <td>Super Admin / Utility Manager</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="level-tag">L3</span></td>
      <td><span class="role-badge badge-green">Finance Manager</span></td>
      <td>Billing, payments, financial reports and credit control. Approves adjustments and reversals.</td>
      <td>Super Admin / Manager</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="level-tag">L4</span></td>
      <td><span class="role-badge badge-green">Billing Officer</span></td>
      <td>Bill generation, payment recording and invoice management. Cannot approve adjustments.</td>
      <td>Manager / Finance Manager</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="level-tag">L5</span></td>
      <td><span class="role-badge badge-gray">Customer Service</span></td>
      <td>Customer enquiries, complaints, and service requests. Read-only on financial records.</td>
      <td>Manager</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="level-tag">L6</span></td>
      <td><span class="role-badge badge-yellow">Metering Supervisor</span></td>
      <td>Meter management, reading approval and inventory oversight. Reviews and approves readings.</td>
      <td>Manager</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="level-tag">L7</span></td>
      <td><span class="role-badge badge-yellow">Field Officer</span></td>
      <td>Meter readings capture, field activities and fault reporting. Mobile app access only.</td>
      <td>Metering Supervisor / Manager</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="level-tag">L8</span></td>
      <td><span class="role-badge badge-gray">Accountant / Cashier</span></td>
      <td>Payments, receipts, and financial reconciliation. Cannot generate bills or make adjustments.</td>
      <td>Finance Manager</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="level-tag">L9</span></td>
      <td><span class="role-badge badge-gray">Auditor</span></td>
      <td>Read-only audit and financial review across all modules. Cannot create or modify any records.</td>
      <td>Super Admin / Manager</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="level-tag">L10</span></td>
      <td><span class="role-badge badge-gray">Customer</span></td>
      <td>Own account access only via customer portal. Can view bills, statements and make payments.</td>
      <td>System (auto-created)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

