<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 4 — FIRST LOGIN INSTRUCTIONS
═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<h2>4. First Login Instructions</h2>

<h3>For the System Administrator</h3>
<ol style="font-size:10.5pt; line-height:1.8;">
  <li>Navigate to <strong>https://app.rumawasco.nexusiot.xyz</strong></li>
  <li>Sign in with email <span class="email">admin@rumawasco.go.ke</span> and password <span class="pwd">password</span></li>
  <li>You will be prompted to change your password immediately</li>
  <li>Go to <strong>Settings &rarr; Users &amp; Access Control</strong></li>
  <li>Click <strong>Invite User</strong> to create accounts for all other staff members</li>
  <li>Assign each user their appropriate role from the table in Section 2</li>
  <li>Instruct each user to change their password on first login</li>
</ol>

<h3>For All Other Users</h3>
<ol style="font-size:10.5pt; line-height:1.8;">
  <li>You will receive an email invitation with your login link</li>
  <li>Use the temporary password provided by the administrator</li>
  <li>Change your password immediately &mdash; choose a strong password of at least 8 characters</li>
  <li>Contact the system administrator if you experience any login issues</li>
</ol>

<div class="warning" style="margin-top:16pt;">
  <strong>&#128274; Password Requirements:</strong> Minimum 8 characters &bull; Mix of uppercase, lowercase, numbers, and symbols recommended &bull; Do not share passwords &bull; Passwords expire every 90 days.
</div>

